OL,3,GNEWSAFood firms hope EU deal will end
OL,4,A'onerous' export process
OL,5,
OL,6,FA sausage manufacturer and a shellfish
OL,7,Fproducer in the East of England say
OL,8,Fthey hope a forthcoming EU summit will
OL,9,Fresult in a deal to make it easier for
OL,10,Fthem to sell to Europe.
OL,12,FThe government is hoping to finalise an
OL,13,Fagreement which would remove
OL,14,Fpost-Brexit checks from food and
OL,15,Fagricultural exports, meaning less
OL,16,Fpaperwork and no more expensive checks.
OL,18,FMinisters say the deal could be worth
OL,19,Fas much as #5bn to the UK economy and
OL,20,Fcould encourage businesses to grow.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
