OL,3,GNEWSAFood firms hope EU deal will end
OL,4,A'onerous' export process
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut an MP who played a leading role in
OL,7,Fthe Leave campaign says the proposed
OL,8,Fdeal would mean the UK following EU
OL,9,Frules again, and the government should
OL,10,Frespect the result of the referendum.
